+# Quick-add a DRAFT claim for the named person, dated the sheet's today with an empty note; a name new to the
+# sheet adds the person first with grade A. One change: a refused quick-add (no name, bad amount, unknown sheet,
+# today in a closed period) adds no person and writes nothing, not even an audit line.
